{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"screens\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把负担理解成喜欢本身带来的负担；完整稿真正表达的是，他怕对方发现自己有多需要亲近，会觉得这种需要成为对方的负担。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"score\": 2,\n      \"wrong\": \"把对方看出他有多在乎，反成了他看出对方有多在乎自己，弄反了在乎的主体和方向；还把害怕对方嫌自己太黏，理解成已经意识到自己太依赖对方。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"score\": 2,\n      \"wrong\": \"把他有点孤单错安到对方身上。完整稿是他自己想继续靠近，却怕要得太多，而对方并不知道他刚才有多害怕被嫌弃。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把跟他在一起的对方也能安心些，转成了他自己逐渐安心。完整稿表达的是他希望自己成为对方可以依靠、感到安心的人，同时他自己仍有渴望和不安，并非已经踏实下来。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"score\": 2,\n      \"wrong\": \"把要是哪天对方不再需要陪伴、甚至觉得不自在的假设性担忧，拼成了两个人现在已经发生了关系变化、相处变得不自在。完整稿明确说眼下两个人仍然亲近，这些都是真的。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"score\": 2,\n      \"wrong\": \"把对方以后还愿不愿意让他陪在身边，不是他能说了算的，拼成了感情的价值不该由对方决定。前者说的是未来能否继续陪伴取决于双方，后者变成了对感情价值的主张；也没有拼出欢喜因害怕失去眼下亲近而压得心口发疼。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把仍嫌相处时间不够、想再多陪一会儿的渴望，概括成了满足。完整稿强调的是高兴终于释放出来，但愿望仍然没有得到充分满足。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S14\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"story\": 3,\n  \"story_note\": \"整体抓住了从小心试探、逐渐享受亲近到坦然表达喜欢的主线，也理解了对未来的担忧和不再隐藏的结尾，但把在乎与孤单的主体弄反、把尚未发生的疏远当成现实变化，并误解了未来陪伴能否继续与感情价值之间的区别，因此大体是同一个故事，却不是完全相同的故事。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b26c096e-a67d-478b-8fee-adcfee558015", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T024454231642Z", "elapsed_seconds": 84.36, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:46:18.593040+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4b586eb5c12f8fa7019dad6bdc95f8157ce44f4355caf532a2f0b5a59ebbfcb5", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T024454231642Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "28071c81fda84f68d69d5590355d022abbf9207c03f1cc6f901284c0137e59f3"}}}
